          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The reference to the Shadow Fold immediately alerts the audience to the concept of a new world, especially when The Darkling explains that it tore the country in two. Our world has not been torn apart by a magical shadow world. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
